[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Actually, I thought that somebody would get Accepted on "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/398/problem/A"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"398A - Cards"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" within 5 minutes. But there wasn't any submissions during the first 4 minutes, and many people got wrong answer on pretests! I think almost everybody who solved this got at least one wrong answer.. I'm really sorry for measuring A easy. I think what "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/cgy4ever"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cgy4ever"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" said is right — it would be better not asking to print the sequence."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At first, I purposed "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/398/problem/C"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"398C - Tree and Array"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" as B(!!) because ainta solved it very easily than I expected. (I could hardly solve this, and thought it must be at least D, before I heard "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/ainta"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ainta"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"'s solution.) We're sorry for giving this problem the same score with "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/398/problem/B"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"398B - Painting The Wall"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":", which was much easier than "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/398/problem/C"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"398C - Tree and Array"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":". Next time I'll remember that "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/ainta"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ainta"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" is really a genius :) "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Congrats to four people who solved "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/398/problem/C"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"398C - Tree and Array"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" during the contest! : "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/cgy4ever"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cgy4ever"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/Shef"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Shef"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/SillyHook06"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"SillyHook06"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":", and "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/Qwaz"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Qwaz"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We are surprised that "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/Petr"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Petr"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" solved "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/398/problem/E"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"398E - Sorting Permutations"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" during the contest! Even though he implemented by Java, his solution is faster than ours :p Congratulations to him!"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Actually, we purposed an another problem for Div1-E, but the same problem popped out at OpenCup last Sunday, so we couldn't use that. Thanks to "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/Gerald"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Gerald"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":", who helped us preparing a new problem in such a short time. By the way, can you guess what problem was that? :D"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"..."}],"kind":"paragrap